MELPA milestone 2 offline fixture: provenance
=============================================

This directory is a hand-built, version-1, network-free fixture used by
tests/automated/elpa-m2-tests.el and
tests/automated/elpa-m2-negative-tests.el.  It vendors five real
upstream artifacts, unmodified, with their embedded copyright and
license notices intact.  No synthetic binary is committed: the tests
tar the checked-in sources under synthetic/ into temporary copies of
the two archives.  The two archive-contents indexes are hand-written
for this fixture (not trimmed from a live index); together they name
every synthetic package and advertise exactly the versions below.

Layout
------

melpa/archive-contents      hand-written version-1 index: the four
                            targets plus the synthetic names
melpa/dmacro-20241027.830.tar
melpa/checkbox-20141117.58.tar
melpa/es-lib-20141111.1830.tar
melpa/buffer-sets-20260817.2118.tar
gnu/archive-contents        hand-written version-1 index: queue and the
                            GNU build of the duplicate m2-dup
gnu/queue-0.2.tar
synthetic/<name>/           checked-in sources for the synthetics:
                            <name>.el and <name>-pkg.el.  Build-only
                            directories: m2-xdep-v2 (rolling upgrade),
                            m2-dup-melpa and m2-dup-gnu (duplicate).
                            m2-nowhere has an index entry only.

